GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`reg 99 — the Secretary of State must not impose a work search requirement` `paragraph (3) applies` `paragraph (4) applies` `paragraph (4A) applies` `paragraph (5) applies` `paragraph (6) applies` MEANS
    (`reg 99(1)(a) — the Secretary of State must not impose a work search requirement` `paragraph (3) applies` `paragraph (4) applies` `paragraph (4A) applies` `paragraph (6) applies`)
    OR (`reg 99(2A)(a) — the Secretary of State must not impose a work search requirement` `paragraph (5) applies`)
